      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Hay otra versión de su nacimiento, la que recogió Emerson.",
          "en": "There is another telling of her birth, the one Emerson recorded."
        },
        {
          "es": "Estas historias se cantaban de memoria, y cada familia de cantores las recordaba un poco distinto.",
          "en": "These stories were chanted from memory, and each family of chanters remembered them a little differently."
        },
        {
          "es": "En ella, Hiʻiaka nació de su madre Haumea, de una forma extraña: por la coronilla de la cabeza.",
          "en": "In it, Hiʻiaka was born from her mother Haumea in a strange way: from the top of her head."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y viajó en la canoa desde Kahiki ya como una niña.",
          "en": "And she traveled in the canoe from Kahiki already as a girl."
        },
        {
          "es": "En las dos versiones, es la más joven de la familia. Y la más querida.",
          "en": "In both tellings, she is the youngest in the family. And the most loved."
        }
      ],
