      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Un día, Pele y sus hermanas bajaron a la costa a buscar erizos y algas.",
          "en": "One day, Pele and her sisters went down to the coast to gather sea urchins and seaweed."
        },
        {
          "es": "Allí vieron a Hōpoe bailando con otra amiga, Haʻena, junto al mar.",
          "en": "There they saw Hōpoe dancing with another friend, Haʻena, beside the sea."
        },
        {
          "es": "Las dos se movían como el viento sobre el agua.",
          "en": "The two of them moved like the wind over the water."
        },
        {
          "es": "A Pele le encantó. «¿No tienen ustedes un baile para contestarles?», preguntó a sus hermanas.",
          "en": "Pele loved it. \"Don't you have a dance to answer them with?\" she asked her sisters."
        },
        {
          "es": "Todas bajaron la cabeza. «No sabemos bailar», dijeron.",
          "en": "They all lowered their heads. \"We have no dance,\" they said."
        }
      ],
